# build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# runtime data
data/
*.log
/tmp/jmapsmtp-last-*.eml

# secrets
config.json
*.pem
*.key
# .asc too: an OpenPGP private key is armoured, and `pgp-private.asc` below is
# exactly that shape. Without this a real exported key committed as easily as
# a public one.
*.asc

# ...except the differential harness's fixtures. These are throwaway keys,
# generated once and committed on purpose: seeding both sides with the SAME
# key is what makes DKIM signatures and TLS certs comparable at all. They are
# never used outside the tests and `xtask difftest`.
#
# Named one by one rather than `!xtask/fixtures/*.pem`, because a pattern here
# is a hole: it un-ignores a *future* file too, so a real key dropped in this
# directory would be committed by the next `git add -A` without a word. These
# three are already public (xtask/fixtures/README.md); nothing else should
# join them by accident.
!xtask/fixtures/dkim-key.pem
!xtask/fixtures/smtp-tls-key.pem
!xtask/fixtures/smtp-tls-cert.pem
!xtask/fixtures/pgp-private.asc
!xtask/fixtures/pgp-public.asc
!xtask/fixtures/pgp-public-relay.asc

# the Go reference implementation (oracle) — built from ~/go-jmapsmtp +
# ~/go-jmapserver by `just oracle`. Never committed: it is a build product of
# two repositories that live outside this one. See PLAN.md §2.3.
/oracle/

# 作業ログと移行手順は手元のもの。SPEC.md と PLAN.md はコードから 125 箇所
# 参照されているので、除外すると公開コードのコメントが宙に浮く。
JOURNAL.md
MIGRATION.md
